  "choice": "PARCEL_ID_NR is WaTech's statewide key (3-digit county FIPS + \"-\" + county parcel number; every non-blank value matches ___-%). Unique in Bellevue; one Yakima key spans two disjoint rows (parts mode). GlobalID is unique too, but it is a row identifier that is not documented as stable across the annual reloads (unverified), so it is not used. ORIG_PARCEL_ID is county-scoped.",
